title: Terry_Intro
---
<<set_left CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<set_right CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Ellis: oh god Fran, you're talking to..... Terry?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: Yeah?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Ellis: what, do you like him or something?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: Ellis you know she's just being nice
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Ellis: oh god Cine, do you like him too?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: Ellis you know it's not like that, just drop it
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Ellis: Fine
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Fran: .....with how much you talk about him maybe you're the one that likes him
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Cine: Fran.....
<<set_left CharacterManager Terry>>
<<wait .15>>
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Hey Terry
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: Ah, Francy, Just the Gal I was lookin for!
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Really?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: Yeah girl, don't be lame. Let's chat!
<<beginning CharacterManager Terry>>
